Take handwritten notes and annotate PDFs with a stylus

Xournal++ is a handwritten note-taking app built for flexibility and speed. Write with a pen tablet or touchscreen stylus on paper backgrounds or on top of PDF documents.

- Pressure-sensitive stylus and pen tablet support, including Wacom, Huion and XP-Pen
- Paper backgrounds for notes, scratch paper or whiteboarding
- Annotate PDF documents
